# Binary assets must never pass through Git's eol/text handling. This repo is
# used with core.autocrlf=true, and an unmarked binary that Git's heuristic
# decides is "text" gets CRLF-normalised on checkout/commit — which is how
# images here were silently corrupted before.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.avif  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
